  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GXyLZjZ.png\" alt=\"神秘農業花園溫室橫幅\" width=\"1079\" height=\"242\">\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>在沉浸工程的花園溫室中種植神秘農業作物！</h3>\n<p>這是一個相容模組，讓你能夠使用沉浸工程的花園溫室來自動化神秘農業。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr style=\"border:1px solid #ddd\"><br>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"center\"><strong>支援的種子：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">🌟 <strong>所有基礎神秘農業種子</strong>：Inferium、Prosperity、Iron 等。\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">🔮 <strong>模組相容性</strong>：Create、AE2、Botania、Draconic Evolution、++</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr style=\"border:1px solid #ddd\">\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>📦 需求</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"width:62.0301%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"center\" style=\"width:50%;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersiveengineering\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/tIm2nV03/icon.png\" alt=\"沉浸工程\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><br>沉浸工程 </a></td>\n<td class=\"center\" style=\"width:50%;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmystical-agriculture\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/C95ReXie/2bddd50d346a470536319c9c1ae6c21f6a5b3e72_96.webp\" alt=\"神秘農業\" width=\"32\"><br>神秘農業 </a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr style=\"border:1px solid #ddd\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>以工業效率自動化你的魔法農耕！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/rVuptEVnNd\" rel=\"nofollow\">💬 Discord</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold\">需要伺服器嗎？</p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fchillzone\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RQmshQt